window.EXAUD={"If Lan practises every day, she will have the ability to swim 500 metres.": "audio/cau/acb77272bebc7012.mp3", "\"Can\" in this sentence shows ability.": "audio/cau/e1e778d1a8135d61.mp3", "Lan is able to swim very well.": "audio/cau/a3fff5ce630221f2.mp3", "He was too tired to be able to relax.": "audio/cau/edfb4c7decfc2430.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "My little sister is afraid of dogs.": "audio/cau/ee10377dda73df15.mp3", "Mi is afraid of the dark, but her brother is brave.": "audio/cau/53d90c9a168e0723.mp3", "Can you say that again, please?": "audio/cau/7e3810543bbdcfd8.mp3", "Mi read the story again and again.": "audio/cau/1afa85aeab810227.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "We can go by bus. Alternatively, we can walk.": "audio/cau/b3bc6464a65f7ee2.mp3", "Alternatively, you can send an email.": "audio/cau/aadd824b69037202.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Art is my favourite subject at school.": "audio/cau/c4a6c2883e22b179.mp3", "Lan loves art, and she wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/0ae231fa580deb96.mp3", "I read an article about robots.": "audio/cau/189446e84c24203c.mp3", "Use the correct article: a, an or the.": "audio/cau/3f36f3691fa7b7aa.mp3", "The artist paints pictures of Hoi An.": "audio/cau/01b6df3137316ebd.mp3", "Minh studies art because he wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/42793539c55d19cc.mp3", "My sister is very artistic.": "audio/cau/b1ceadac7bb085f5.mp3", "This painting has great artistic value.": "audio/cau/62c3d0ee107bea69.mp3", "I join the arts and crafts club after school.": "audio/cau/5e7e932441dc0390.mp3", "Art is fun, so Hoa joins the arts club on Fridays.": "audio/cau/d5e1ea90f787b38b.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "We have a school assembly on Monday.": "audio/cau/8cce9f4203e028bd.mp3", "This is a car assembly line.": "audio/cau/5212b496e3a1524d.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "She became a famous writer at the age of 30.": "audio/cau/d039f1fb340db200.mp3", "Nam's father became a doctor, and Nam wants to become one.": "audio/cau/75c8536f0f8b5b1b.mp3", "The city has become more crowded.": "audio/cau/e4616f3fdd933bf4.mp3", "Lan became a teacher, and her brother will become a doctor.": "audio/cau/534acc7a3aea852d.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "Thank you for being so kind to me.": "audio/cau/a75c0878deadd1e7.mp3", "Being a doctor is hard, but my aunt is happy.": "audio/cau/4aa63f5a96fb8206.mp3", "I believe you.": "audio/cau/c1b7bfc3adc01b41.mp3", "Do you believe in ghosts?": "audio/cau/83a7564931d63151.mp3", "Besides, I also tried to follow a healthy diet.": "audio/cau/8c6b708cf4c7209e.mp3", "Besides football, Nam plays badminton.": "audio/cau/75b5a2409b53f5fe.mp3", "Lan is my best friend.": "audio/cau/9edc7bdf247f31c3.mp3", "Mi's drawing is good, Nam's is better, but Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/c2336133ff2dce7f.mp3", "Life in the city is better for me.": "audio/cau/1aaaaca243bd56b5.mp3", "Lan's drawing is good, Mi's is better, and Hoa's is the best.": "audio/cau/eb8986ba6f0ca74b.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "The brave firefighter saved the child.": "audio/cau/c5f5659aed1d4fdc.mp3", "Nam acted bravely, and everyone praised his bravery.": "audio/cau/5e436b348da6c7e0.mp3", "The soldiers fought bravely.": "audio/cau/045fc0af7219bf44.mp3", "She bravely saved the child.": "audio/cau/8aab295633f99328.mp3", "Thanh Giong is famous for his bravery.": "audio/cau/43d9254c5d6fb603.mp3", "He got a medal for bravery.": "audio/cau/85c39743a809730b.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "She answered calmly.": "audio/cau/c0bc67ad5450e5d5.mp3", "Walk out calmly when there is a fire.": "audio/cau/fad079b435374c70.mp3", "I admire his calmness.": "audio/cau/005245e1abe4ac55.mp3", "Yoga brings calmness.": "audio/cau/68f38a4c896ebb4a.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "He is capable of doing this job.": "audio/cau/112140d1da47c4cf.mp3", "She is a capable student.": "audio/cau/79085b8206828a93.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "She wants a career in medicine.": "audio/cau/dfb8aa868f280f7b.mp3", "He had a long career as a teacher.": "audio/cau/87dd212fe8a2de15.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "Listen carefully and repeat after me.": "audio/cau/ad3f1bf6d7562211.mp3", "Mi is careful, so she always writes carefully.": "audio/cau/6be5befe9f5467c7.mp3", "Don't be careless with fire.": "audio/cau/3fa8f5ce401f56eb.mp3", "He made a careless mistake.": "audio/cau/0e576f1b557d8217.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "Let's play a memory challenge in pairs.": "audio/cau/087734251efbe84e.mp3", "Learning new words is a fun challenge.": "audio/cau/c2202c8e65187d81.mp3", "One good teacher can change your life.": "audio/cau/a24566287e5a310e.mp3", "The city changed a lot, and the change is good.": "audio/cau/c2d3e45906274d36.mp3", "The weather in spring is changeable.": "audio/cau/da8f6cf3533cf6e8.mp3", "His mood is very changeable.": "audio/cau/d761822654a22f3f.mp3", "The trip changed her ideas about life.": "audio/cau/da028a9e62cf7a21.mp3", "My village changed after the new road was built.": "audio/cau/f31b9b1d46f2277f.mp3", "There are many changes in my hometown.": "audio/cau/5842dc08b691ba71.mp3", "Our town has made big changes, like new parks.": "audio/cau/d966270acb3214fd.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "There are many choices on the menu.": "audio/cau/1f222063b28d7615.mp3", "Make healthy food choices.": "audio/cau/430025ea2ad0eec0.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "Students collaborate on group projects.": "audio/cau/51b02c4161792cc5.mp3", "Two schools collaborate to plant trees.": "audio/cau/f42e14482ad90ebb.mp3", "What colour is her hair?": "audio/cau/e7aa61d42982634f.mp3", "My favourite colour is blue, and my room is colourful.": "audio/cau/65b041dfbe52909f.mp3", "My bedroom has colourful walls.": "audio/cau/5480caf95b688723.mp3", "Each colour is bright, so the picture is colourful.": "audio/cau/c94ba14044838a90.mp3", "We communicate with friends by email.": "audio/cau/71c0cac04361b2eb.mp3", "Good communication helps us communicate better.": "audio/cau/83b537bc6eb88878.mp3", "Communication is important in a team.": "audio/cau/ceae7194d8982d8f.mp3", "We communicate in English to improve our communication skills.": "audio/cau/78dbdceb83728ae8.mp3", "She is a communicative student.": "audio/cau/c7fbc92e73c9d5a0.mp3", "Be communicative with your classmates.": "audio/cau/dde8f897fd3f06c4.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Can you compute the total cost?": "audio/cau/a8d41aba6d2ab55f.mp3", "Machines can compute very fast.": "audio/cau/72c349cdf691477f.mp3", "He bought his first computer at sixteen.": "audio/cau/89b36254c871cb46.mp3", "She studied computing and now makes computer games.": "audio/cau/bc002ad22303f977.mp3", "Our school has a room with thirty computers.": "audio/cau/ac2ba23903c9f31f.mp3", "He wanted to make computers easy for everyone.": "audio/cau/fc560f3198d929fc.mp3", "Computing is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/bd53d2b166706315.mp3", "She wants to study computing at university.": "audio/cau/dc25a1b43d7542f9.mp3", "He spoke confidently in front of the class.": "audio/cau/472a60af17760a83.mp3", "Walk confidently onto the stage.": "audio/cau/4b1bbb9324fc0c5c.mp3", "Consider your answer before you speak.": "audio/cau/aa283697b91d51a7.mp3", "We are considering a trip to Huế.": "audio/cau/d54aa62d0d4e182d.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "Practise the conversations with your partner.": "audio/cau/1d30e8173711a087.mp3", "Each conversation is short, so the conversations are easy.": "audio/cau/1993b4c73be239ce.mp3", "We converse in English in class.": "audio/cau/53bd8ab15aee8ea4.mp3", "They conversed for hours.": "audio/cau/0ca95dc23e5e741b.mp3", "Thanks for your cooperation.": "audio/cau/d29faba5310e58c1.mp3", "Teamwork needs good cooperation.": "audio/cau/8818c86d83457bf4.mp3", "Could you tell me the way to the market?": "audio/cau/caec542f1754918b.mp3", "I can swim now, but I could not swim last year.": "audio/cau/15650b94c8bd4313.mp3", "I couldn't sleep because of the noise.": "audio/cau/b74c0028cf6704f5.mp3", "Lan could swim, but she couldn't ride a bike.": "audio/cau/478ae99fe7a51e30.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "The courageous boy saved his friend.": "audio/cau/199edd46d4557496.mp3", "Firefighters are courageous people.": "audio/cau/81c150be0bdd095a.mp3", "Of course, I can help you.": "audio/cau/fd7c10e38552c9bd.mp3", "Mi is taking a cooking course this summer.": "audio/cau/29a5261c025cf175.mp3", "It was cowardly to run away.": "audio/cau/02a40aa08af02cb7.mp3", "The cowardly lion was afraid of everything.": "audio/cau/9403f252500ab135.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "We are creating a poster for our project.": "audio/cau/848ff93fc11713a4.mp3", "Hoa likes creating stories, and she is very creative.": "audio/cau/99e93cd957a2b714.mp3", "This dish is the chef's own creation.": "audio/cau/fc920ec6ff357284.mp3", "The creation of the park took two years.": "audio/cau/e03b9893206b7583.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "He is the creator of this cartoon.": "audio/cau/acc70c5a959cdcc3.mp3", "She is a young content creator.": "audio/cau/e8d143a8558b806e.mp3", "Please cut the paper into small pieces.": "audio/cau/a1fd8b0ff53be3ae.mp3", "Yesterday Nam cut the cake for his friends.": "audio/cau/97279c7011b57f8b.mp3", "Use a paper cutter carefully.": "audio/cau/e32df5377a73513b.mp3", "Mum has a cookie cutter shaped like a star.": "audio/cau/dc1ab9c2ecff77a5.mp3", "My dad is cutting the grass in the garden.": "audio/cau/de769b78036d1e0b.mp3", "We are cutting down on plastic bags, and last month we cut down on paper too.": "audio/cau/9f9ddd6ec177ddbf.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "Playing on the road is dangerous.": "audio/cau/3bf8cadff14ebae2.mp3", "Fire is a danger, so it is dangerous to play with matches.": "audio/cau/0f659a664b64ff32.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "Teenagers can make their own decisions.": "audio/cau/b5431769132caed1.mp3", "Good leaders make quick decisions.": "audio/cau/8839e0dccae57664.mp3", "It is 30 degrees today.": "audio/cau/5472efc600681ce8.mp3", "My sister has a degree in English.": "audio/cau/3f80644a2b10a4a8.mp3", "Our trip depends on the weather.": "audio/cau/f830d432fd192907.mp3", "Children depend on their parents.": "audio/cau/3bae63134e7d207d.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "We live in a digital world.": "audio/cau/4f7f30ea17f17a0d.mp3", "I have a digital camera.": "audio/cau/14297d0353475d90.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "My mother is a doctor.": "audio/cau/a2d64825398e2176.mp3", "The doctor works in a hospital with many nurses.": "audio/cau/ef4dd053e035391b.mp3", "Doctors help sick people every day.": "audio/cau/8296cd3d90bf4219.mp3", "Lan wants to be a doctor like her parents.": "audio/cau/7b173db9036b28fb.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "My sister earns money by teaching English.": "audio/cau/c708ac6757535a40.mp3", "Farmers earn money from selling rice.": "audio/cau/03d9921e17db3edc.mp3", "My father is an engineer.": "audio/cau/cdd8a4927ecc40e0.mp3", "The engineer built a new bridge.": "audio/cau/22076e7df9759986.mp3", "Engineers are designing a new robot.": "audio/cau/1dda86937264b48e.mp3", "Many engineers work in this factory.": "audio/cau/3de63edb92d1df1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "I like fruit, especially mangoes.": "audio/cau/5cb422786a2c834f.mp3", "The city is noisy, especially at rush hour.": "audio/cau/fcaea83ef9e28d5b.mp3", "He even worked at night to help his family.": "audio/cau/35c426a9236c1cc0.mp3", "It is cold here, even in summer.": "audio/cau/65983b86a05b922c.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "She excels at maths.": "audio/cau/189cef5080b7a458.mp3", "He excels in sports.": "audio/cau/28d9649e2db915c6.mp3", "Our school is known for excellence in teaching.": "audio/cau/bd51c7b26703ffd9.mp3", "She got an award for excellence.": "audio/cau/e102f2ac0cb5c3d0.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "The team played excellently.": "audio/cau/f46f094c071d44fe.mp3", "She sang the song excellently.": "audio/cau/5aead8608ae5d92b.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Write T for true or F for false.": "audio/cau/d086c486993b428b.mp3", "Sentence 2 is false, so Nam writes F.": "audio/cau/87a27d221b2ce0ec.mp3", "Wash your face before breakfast.": "audio/cau/b40392145a1b9e72.mp3", "Hoa has a round face, and we draw funny faces.": "audio/cau/bed7bfe736a05e74.mp3", "The children have happy faces.": "audio/cau/326d20380efdc287.mp3", "Phong has an oval face. Look at our faces in the photo.": "audio/cau/f76c0b6fc6a16fb9.mp3", "His facial expression showed he was angry.": "audio/cau/7d1a424cbbfd0671.mp3", "Emojis copy our facial expressions.": "audio/cau/2ec8636c8fa6f1d7.mp3", "Is this sentence true or false?": "audio/cau/b08a12186b6dfb5e.mp3", "That answer is false, but Hoa's answer is true.": "audio/cau/493842939182df2a.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "She always wears fashionable clothes.": "audio/cau/224deed31a6b7076.mp3", "This hairstyle is very fashionable now.": "audio/cau/a5da03bcff324a2f.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "She has a thousand followers online.": "audio/cau/23024d95c73edb6e.mp3", "He is a follower of the football team.": "audio/cau/d212f1f4123de65f.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "In the future, cities will have more green spaces.": "audio/cau/a1ba49d0a94f167b.mp3", "We can't change the past, but we can change the future.": "audio/cau/3541478809f66efb.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "My mother has long black hair.": "audio/cau/41b2fceab317cdd9.mp3", "Phong's hair is short because he had a haircut.": "audio/cau/63f3438257726452.mp3", "I need a haircut.": "audio/cau/7d93abbd1c7b72f7.mp3", "Do you like my new haircut?": "audio/cau/f47102da0cfc35d6.mp3", "My aunt is a hairdresser.": "audio/cau/08be3cd9c8f14bf9.mp3", "I go to the hairdresser's once a month.": "audio/cau/a2858025cc239abe.mp3", "The hairdressers in this shop are very friendly.": "audio/cau/98f9cc270ce55655.mp3", "My aunt and her sister are hairdressers.": "audio/cau/55fdc092a74bd496.mp3", "I like your new hairstyle.": "audio/cau/6cdffe42ca43d068.mp3", "Mai has a short hairstyle this year.": "audio/cau/6b8a6d96cd1bb0d9.mp3", "Girls in my class have different hairstyles.": "audio/cau/4c31d14ac31bf4dc.mp3", "This magazine shows many new hairstyles.": "audio/cau/871270f9439f77a6.mp3", "My dog has long, hairy ears.": "audio/cau/041d7835247f9da0.mp3", "The spider has hairy legs.": "audio/cau/f2a919f0ec51fd15.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My little brother has a round head.": "audio/cau/9b2b66e5668763ca.mp3", "Nam has a headache, so his head hurts.": "audio/cau/ae5fd0fd3be2e909.mp3", "It rained heavily last night.": "audio/cau/1a3ae2881e3af6a8.mp3", "The city is heavily polluted.": "audio/cau/30feb15789eaf8ce.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Please hold my bag for a moment.": "audio/cau/c556d9592e549b94.mp3", "Our school holds a sports day every year.": "audio/cau/290d899c332b44e8.mp3", "I hope we will arrive at the city square in time.": "audio/cau/4cf4b919d975b51c.mp3", "Mi is hopeful; she hopes to pass the exam.": "audio/cau/b10ada31860f43ff.mp3", "We are hopeful about the future.": "audio/cau/a7f4ae7a6bf43e95.mp3", "She is hopeful that she will pass.": "audio/cau/4f22f41caccff88f.mp3", "Hopefully, it will be sunny tomorrow.": "audio/cau/68cf1245c287731d.mp3", "Hopefully, I can visit you next week.": "audio/cau/d64b99261d38e74d.mp3", "I'm hopeless at drawing.": "audio/cau/fc641817792db467.mp3", "Don't feel hopeless; try again.": "audio/cau/e090d59a3e8b06b6.mp3", "How did he become a famous doctor?": "audio/cau/0acfb865542d1705.mp3", "How old is Minh, and how does he go to school?": "audio/cau/0d6be1faa0d18a2b.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "That's a good idea!": "audio/cau/5032b596323554f3.mp3", "Nam has an idea for our project about houses.": "audio/cau/db4e4feff1dcab04.mp3", "Children are very imaginative.": "audio/cau/b79c2430e0adaf24.mp3", "She wrote an imaginative story.": "audio/cau/313d8314337fb59d.mp3", "We talked about the importance of local crafts.": "audio/cau/1dd1fbbbd5db7ba1.mp3", "Sleep is important; we all know its importance.": "audio/cau/39fdef6a24182eb1.mp3", "It is important to keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/4541b30fbeb1b8aa.mp3", "Reading is important; never forget its importance.": "audio/cau/0b2b91b8a69bb8c9.mp3", "More importantly, we must save water.": "audio/cau/09a367b8deac295f.mp3", "Most importantly, be kind to others.": "audio/cau/8709c00d7d3b3af1.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "English is increasingly important.": "audio/cau/44385c31cf25c301.mp3", "The weather is getting increasingly hot.": "audio/cau/eed1dc47f156d905.mp3", "Scientists have inquiring minds.": "audio/cau/a1e0fed8d8786d80.mp3", "She is an inquiring student.": "audio/cau/b2bae2cd28a5f7b2.mp3", "Don't study late at night. Instead, study a little every day.": "audio/cau/2ad56ca0ade4766f.mp3", "Let's walk to school instead of going by motorbike.": "audio/cau/b919b74d76e73f4c.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "My father has a job in a hospital.": "audio/cau/5bbe212d5f4f6b36.mp3", "Good job, Mi! You finished your work early.": "audio/cau/1fb5d09e0e0e0c1f.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "I'm keen on playing football.": "audio/cau/80f08f94a97d96b0.mp3", "She is a keen reader.": "audio/cau/6355620b0cd77341.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "The zoo keeper feeds the animals.": "audio/cau/06704e78accc1c51.mp3", "Our keeper saved the ball.": "audio/cau/af8db4e0f0173737.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "She smiled kindly at me.": "audio/cau/1f6770a4e642e4ad.mp3", "He kindly helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/355561eff4531966.mp3", "Thank you for your kindness.": "audio/cau/5a1909574805c9b6.mp3", "Small acts of kindness make people happy.": "audio/cau/591eeb7107114f71.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "Don't be late for school!": "audio/cau/2de1bb7c8bcc4ad3.mp3", "Mi was late, but Nam came early.": "audio/cau/1f3ff224e4611670.mp3", "The police make people obey the law.": "audio/cau/344fc49bdf9ae35a.mp3", "My uncle is a lawyer, so he knows the law well.": "audio/cau/c2ce07c6a98d1cc0.mp3", "It is lawful to fish in this lake.": "audio/cau/b5dd5a5d78c5b653.mp3", "Everyone should do lawful things.": "audio/cau/615a2b08f9d7b4b4.mp3", "My aunt is a lawyer.": "audio/cau/48d7ceb9f8036890.mp3", "I want to be a lawyer in the future.": "audio/cau/b9fca0fefe1072d5.mp3", "The guide will lead us to the cave.": "audio/cau/fec30eb491d4e7ec.mp3", "Eating too much sugar can lead to health problems.": "audio/cau/feb456adaea6d50e.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "She is a fast learner.": "audio/cau/bdda689dc68ad8a3.mp3", "This book is for English learners.": "audio/cau/5aa493db6a382d2e.mp3", "They are learning English now.": "audio/cau/dd1a1d45e6dbee72.mp3", "Mi is learning to swim; she learnt a lot last week.": "audio/cau/f28b08757f5f0cdc.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Mi made a list of things she likes about Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/f8777869fe331844.mp3", "Please list three problems of city life on your list.": "audio/cau/76a5712737ad94a8.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "We have a washing machine in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/80c9ca83964b6779.mp3", "This machine is new, but the old machines still work.": "audio/cau/55f794e1e615e30c.mp3", "Farmers use modern machinery today.": "audio/cau/7c78eb94cf333d37.mp3", "The factory has a lot of machinery.": "audio/cau/efb96b6408c3bde7.mp3", "Today, machines help people make pottery faster.": "audio/cau/11a7fb29c1a3cfa8.mp3", "This machine is old, but the other machines are new.": "audio/cau/9a40a840ffa80367.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "Mai is making a birthday card for Lan.": "audio/cau/dc70bb88704df4a4.mp3", "We are making paper flowers; we made ten yesterday.": "audio/cau/2de37c2668104819.mp3", "My brother practises martial arts.": "audio/cau/83f491def89c3a97.mp3", "Vovinam is a Vietnamese martial art.": "audio/cau/44a1f477ef8403f0.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "There is a medical centre near my house.": "audio/cau/d46abef3b2f532cb.mp3", "Doctors give medical help and medicine to sick people.": "audio/cau/6d4f6be5681ac473.mp3", "This plant is medically useful.": "audio/cau/9f2fdf1b7b32d230.mp3", "He is medically fit to play sports.": "audio/cau/2b73e9bbc7937ca6.mp3", "Take this medicine after meals.": "audio/cau/7ab100bdb9a45ee8.mp3", "She wants to study medicine.": "audio/cau/5deb76cde628f93a.mp3", "There are many methods to save water.": "audio/cau/226f23561a4955df.mp3", "Farmers use modern methods now.": "audio/cau/14bebb2c5f9bc541.mp3", "Keep your goal in mind and work hard.": "audio/cau/d67edfb408f8ae2b.mp3", "Lan changed her mind and decided to become a doctor.": "audio/cau/24e15176df525aa5.mp3", "Be mindful of other people's feelings.": "audio/cau/1c8d2a36f81282fc.mp3", "We should be mindful when we eat.": "audio/cau/5bfc6f269f453c90.mp3", "The flat is big. Moreover, it is cheap.": "audio/cau/c5fbb0c1b6482deb.mp3", "Cycling is fun. Moreover, it is healthy.": "audio/cau/a33407044953c815.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My family will move to Da Nang next year.": "audio/cau/52a8b01da231ec79.mp3", "We moved to a new flat, and we don't want to move again.": "audio/cau/1f00cc6fb33d58c8.mp3", "Dancing needs fast movement.": "audio/cau/9a664a2d00ce92c8.mp3", "Our school joins the Green Movement.": "audio/cau/c60e5122169e11a9.mp3", "Moving to a new city can be hard.": "audio/cau/2fa286a0802dcc57.mp3", "They are moving to Ha Noi because they want to move near work.": "audio/cau/7d2136ef12f1a387.mp3", "You must wear a uniform at school.": "audio/cau/46580b2b85391334.mp3", "We must be quiet, and we mustn't run in the classroom.": "audio/cau/c40bacc8d34e5f31.mp3", "You mustn't run in the classroom.": "audio/cau/0ed0fba5ab359db1.mp3", "We mustn't litter in the park.": "audio/cau/9440555771e727e2.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Is it necessary to wear a helmet?": "audio/cau/310488fddb9b7077.mp3", "Water is necessary for life; it is a basic necessity.": "audio/cau/1c5a7a36e7e8db29.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "If I have all the needed ingredients, I can make a delicious pizza.": "audio/cau/b8863fe0f2752a65.mp3", "Hoa brings all the needed books to class.": "audio/cau/8b00a387319795d2.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "After a long negotiation, they agreed.": "audio/cau/efe084992e66a260.mp3", "Negotiation is an important skill.": "audio/cau/45b0465e06780c49.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My dad works in an office in the city centre.": "audio/cau/aa89d0f583477234.mp3", "The post office is next to my school.": "audio/cau/3da95b799a14618f.mp3", "A police officer helps people cross the road.": "audio/cau/86b7b65996cb4b92.mp3", "My uncle is an officer, and he works in a big office.": "audio/cau/20f5f9bd56049dd7.mp3", "Police officers keep our city safe.": "audio/cau/dc85908456060d9c.mp3", "One officer works here, and two other officers work in that office.": "audio/cau/0298277ff67ffa35.mp3", "You can use this app offline.": "audio/cau/b65397a82242d474.mp3", "I prefer offline activities.": "audio/cau/6ca4967b134ef528.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "Many people in the city shop online.": "audio/cau/c85f222ff84a2f97.mp3", "I study online at home, but my brother works offline.": "audio/cau/a56dad97dab97579.mp3", "Please open your books to page twenty.": "audio/cau/53593951c79684b4.mp3", "Open the window, but close the door.": "audio/cau/7aa87d369a509fca.mp3", "Where is the bottle opener?": "audio/cau/dba02936e0725420.mp3", "I need a can opener.": "audio/cau/adb4ffcc3719f644.mp3", "The opening of your talk should be interesting.": "audio/cau/7a05b586b50872dd.mp3", "The library will open today; come to the opening at 9 a.m.": "audio/cau/ba81136abf0a6d5d.mp3", "Big cities offer many job opportunities.": "audio/cau/d98456cec3c3c588.mp3", "Students have opportunities to travel abroad.": "audio/cau/a52d81a7fdc0202e.mp3", "This is a great opportunity for you.": "audio/cau/c8ae933f7f99f30f.mp3", "I had the opportunity to meet a famous writer.": "audio/cau/96e1238eb168c7b6.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "She is an outstanding student.": "audio/cau/114d138533e97e0b.mp3", "The team gave an outstanding performance.": "audio/cau/30f6882f94f7003e.mp3", "She started her own business at the age of 25.": "audio/cau/6b63e0d466da083a.mp3", "Lan has her own bike, and her dad owns a shop.": "audio/cau/3e685e99b02109d7.mp3", "Who is the owner of this bag?": "audio/cau/267db4164d6de47a.mp3", "Mi is the owner of the blue bike.": "audio/cau/6fd99520869ed0ff.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "Bui Xuan Phai was a famous painter.": "audio/cau/e14d987a0690234b.mp3", "I want to be a painter.": "audio/cau/0f75ae1798d419c4.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "The city is particularly busy at night.": "audio/cau/916c287a4ac2b992.mp3", "Many students, particularly in big cities, learn English after school.": "audio/cau/fb835b6704343246.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "Our school has a partnership with a school in Japan.": "audio/cau/94480f1a5b1a2bf9.mp3", "Good partnership makes good results.": "audio/cau/6f55e8eb690f4709.mp3", "She worked hard to pass the exam.": "audio/cau/26302a722b94d220.mp3", "Nam passed the test, but his friend failed it.": "audio/cau/b34e4c8e9faf7f31.mp3", "In the past, people wrote letters by hand.": "audio/cau/89dfbd0ce69e6ac3.mp3", "Learn from the past and plan for the future.": "audio/cau/11c99eed5de3f605.mp3", "Follow the path to the lake.": "audio/cau/a292396dcc067c9b.mp3", "There is a path through the forest.": "audio/cau/a40866393ab3a557.mp3", "The park has many paths.": "audio/cau/35513897e7a8dccf.mp3", "Keep the paths clean.": "audio/cau/892235b74a64558e.mp3", "Artisans must be patient and careful.": "audio/cau/90cae0ea2a36b6ed.mp3", "My grandma waits patiently, but I am impatient.": "audio/cau/12aeb5fc83950967.mp3", "Doctors and nurses look after patients.": "audio/cau/eacdfbed1367e485.mp3", "The doctor is patient with every patient.": "audio/cau/8ebddfb0d3352986.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "I persuaded my dad to buy a dog.": "audio/cau/3a4dae6368e0867b.mp3", "Can you persuade her to join us?": "audio/cau/cdc027fc35778760.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "The police help people in our community.": "audio/cau/4ef571d5bbc21339.mp3", "A police officer prevents crime and protects people.": "audio/cau/45b5a4626fc1cdb3.mp3", "The policeman helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/45d9aae4924c7f5a.mp3", "His father is a policeman.": "audio/cau/da15856077051688.mp3", "The policewoman showed us the way.": "audio/cau/533442eb9415e8df.mp3", "My aunt is a policewoman.": "audio/cau/4f03fa2f3bc91f4b.mp3", "He was born into a poor family.": "audio/cau/f960f9dc0b1abeb6.mp3", "She helped poor children and fought against poverty.": "audio/cau/f7b2c8475fadd81a.mp3", "This singer is popular with teenagers.": "audio/cau/fdbd5fd7ebddf922.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "The game's popularity is growing.": "audio/cau/126119d057896ab4.mp3", "K-pop has great popularity in Vietnam.": "audio/cau/edcc5616984001a4.mp3", "Cooking is a practical skill.": "audio/cau/5a6f0d10ec24d299.mp3", "We need a practical plan.": "audio/cau/56e265a6b72df8e8.mp3", "Football practice is on Saturday morning.": "audio/cau/6494d311fac68397.mp3", "We practise English every day because practice makes perfect.": "audio/cau/41b3647f667733f3.mp3", "Practise your presentation with a partner.": "audio/cau/e4a37f8bf22b9aea.mp3", "Lan practises English every day, and practice makes perfect.": "audio/cau/51c0a5aed4c497dd.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "The school provides free lunch.": "audio/cau/1f694f01addd8209.mp3", "Trees provide shade.": "audio/cau/c989999ea62ae048.mp3", "The community centre provided free lessons for children.": "audio/cau/5f9c54b68891da3e.mp3", "Libraries provide books for everyone.": "audio/cau/1a64bfbcc616fb7b.mp3", "Which internet provider do you use?": "audio/cau/f9b72e33887e811f.mp3", "She is the main provider for her family.": "audio/cau/af87522c8ed30119.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "We can reach the city centre by bus.": "audio/cau/04ff8a28c2c1ea1e.mp3", "The bus line doesn't reach my village yet.": "audio/cau/7e34175d758a85c7.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Are you ready for the test?": "audio/cau/17e9fc7efe8e545f.mp3", "Tell the class when your picture is ready.": "audio/cau/721442113077f658.mp3", "She holds three national records.": "audio/cau/64e3914f110d70ef.mp3", "The school keeps students' records.": "audio/cau/0e757c4c38eef426.mp3", "We rehearse the play every afternoon.": "audio/cau/dac831cb2d621532.mp3", "Rehearse your speech before class.": "audio/cau/7d9c21f2e524eaef.mp3", "These questions relate to the text.": "audio/cau/5f9d333f7b98fff6.mp3", "I can relate to her story.": "audio/cau/37c2f70ea8b4b0c8.mp3", "The work is repetitive.": "audio/cau/b61343ced873f41a.mp3", "Repetitive exercises help you remember.": "audio/cau/fc9fbaa0a249e931.mp3", "Replace the old battery with a new one.": "audio/cau/cc8740e743a1d047.mp3", "Can robots replace teachers?": "audio/cau/4a8ceb4ceec85234.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Report your group's ideas to the class.": "audio/cau/6522433ccfce4976.mp3", "The reporter wrote a report about our village.": "audio/cau/136adff9e04b464a.mp3", "The reporter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/3220169670e28ec1.mp3", "She wants to be a TV reporter.": "audio/cau/d6499b08f001431b.mp3", "The work is required to be completed by Monday.": "audio/cau/70259cf129884641.mp3", "Students are required to wear uniforms.": "audio/cau/218ab214ad50b076.mp3", "Restart your computer.": "audio/cau/b7d451ba5c736617.mp3", "We will restart the game after lunch.": "audio/cau/f73484ffdfba2234.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "This is an important rule in our class.": "audio/cau/96a662d6bd5d9b43.mp3", "Follow every rule and don't break the school rules.": "audio/cau/65eaa6eda384e8c3.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Is this street safe for children?": "audio/cau/88631db36043d27e.mp3", "Wear a helmet to stay safe; safety comes first.": "audio/cau/d8ce6c3794f2a6d1.mp3", "Please cross the road safely.": "audio/cau/5528689194c1f4f4.mp3", "Ride safely, because a safe trip matters most.": "audio/cau/ca8923e81a7485a5.mp3", "Road safety is very important in big cities.": "audio/cau/200fb9d1edce66da.mp3", "For your safety, ride safely and wear a helmet.": "audio/cau/5a79a81a197cf572.mp3", "My aunt works at a hair salon.": "audio/cau/892c40a7a46735be.mp3", "She goes to the salon every month.": "audio/cau/7b84e8006feb4e1d.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "Always keep your online password secure.": "audio/cau/55026a5aae232387.mp3", "The door is secure with a strong lock.": "audio/cau/35596e516583eb26.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "The fruit seller smiled at us.": "audio/cau/0ff413993586e1c1.mp3", "Ask the seller about the price.": "audio/cau/e34ff5e97a142c6f.mp3", "The seller's stall is near the gate.": "audio/cau/260639bb5100a1b8.mp3", "I liked the seller's friendly smile.": "audio/cau/e606d9f24dd620cf.mp3", "Street sellers sell food on the pavement.": "audio/cau/2d264ea9b896f151.mp3", "There are many flower sellers before Tet.": "audio/cau/85719614b75b79ba.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "You should take your studies seriously.": "audio/cau/e88439f0e0925b11.mp3", "He was seriously hurt in the accident.": "audio/cau/f04641a6b264b636.mp3", "Shortly after that, he moved to Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/11ea9cd1ebe627ae.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so wait here.": "audio/cau/c03ac79a596be37a.mp3", "You should eat more vegetables.": "audio/cau/d3873c12c668ddab.mp3", "We should recycle, and we shouldn't waste water.": "audio/cau/bdd4848df2193265.mp3", "You shouldn't stay up too late.": "audio/cau/680bdbc9338f8ccb.mp3", "You should sleep early and shouldn't skip breakfast.": "audio/cau/a2f566a8bdd973cf.mp3", "There is a significant change in the weather.": "audio/cau/67863b502f69860b.mp3", "Mid-Autumn is a significant festival for children.": "audio/cau/74a1c5a832bdca70.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "There is a similarity between the two stories.": "audio/cau/5e7f0978e1ff716e.mp3", "I see a similarity between you and your mum.": "audio/cau/6cf9435c1f3a000c.mp3", "The two sisters dress similarly.": "audio/cau/5e58452bd7fa9e2e.mp3", "Similarly, we should save electricity at school.": "audio/cau/124a6e7eba967203.mp3", "He is a skilful football player.": "audio/cau/646304253edddd34.mp3", "My grandma is skilful at making cakes.": "audio/cau/1c690c4f9b9e86c6.mp3", "Swimming is a very useful skill.": "audio/cau/d7241d53b77c087e.mp3", "Mi is skilled at drawing; it's her best skill.": "audio/cau/cc6e45a927c9f99f.mp3", "My uncle is a skilled artisan in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e68305c55d01384c.mp3", "Making pottery is a skill, and he is very skilled.": "audio/cau/9b117236c0cf5e21.mp3", "We learn new skills at the English club.": "audio/cau/84d5837cc14182f6.mp3", "Listening is an important skill, and speaking skills are useful too.": "audio/cau/18ae79d29069fa38.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "We use this software to learn English.": "audio/cau/0362daa938440006.mp3", "Dad installed new software on my computer.": "audio/cau/4e88fe3df6e8477f.mp3", "See you soon at school, Mi!": "audio/cau/fec53904fbd07d51.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so we'll be home soon.": "audio/cau/b92c6bf10bdd4a35.mp3", "Please sort the rubbish before you throw it away.": "audio/cau/6c05fa141d6fcfcf.mp3", "What sort of rubbish can we recycle?": "audio/cau/ece2a3deda17cf66.mp3", "Tet is a special time for Vietnamese families.": "audio/cau/5f60a4fd69577fbf.mp3", "Com is a speciality of Ha Noi, and it's very special.": "audio/cau/d7109b486b9421a3.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "We had spring rolls as a starter.": "audio/cau/28024f2227f60323.mp3", "Would you like a starter?": "audio/cau/547893b9dae758e2.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "Lan is studying for her English test now.": "audio/cau/cb697036271d7db2.mp3", "The students are studying in the library.": "audio/cau/3e449c654c7e4156.mp3", "Turn on the English subtitle, please.": "audio/cau/05a13efc24091c94.mp3", "This subtitle is too small to read.": "audio/cau/63ad2fc79e804836.mp3", "The school festival was very successful.": "audio/cau/07a76776fe266387.mp3", "He is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/48de355a4bcefbea.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "This photo was taken in Hue.": "audio/cau/f504f1fe8bdf2bf6.mp3", "Have you taken your medicine?": "audio/cau/28798ff67a8368e9.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "Mai does the most important task first.": "audio/cau/a603b10339a760c3.mp3", "Cleaning the room is Nam's task today.": "audio/cau/ae2aa24fce0f8a61.mp3", "A calendar helps Lan remember her tasks.": "audio/cau/3738ebba96d99a2d.mp3", "Minh writes his tasks on a to-do list.": "audio/cau/071032038aeed4d4.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "The teacher's desk is next to the board.": "audio/cau/117c585a8118e3fc.mp3", "Please put your books on the teacher's table.": "audio/cau/a102c5684f7ac5bc.mp3", "We are thankful to our teachers.": "audio/cau/7371a36dadb99e53.mp3", "Our teachers help us every day.": "audio/cau/7e121ff7d4ccdde3.mp3", "Ms Lan is teaching Class 6A now.": "audio/cau/acf50be4cb481bbc.mp3", "My aunt is a teacher; she loves teaching.": "audio/cau/8c228681a916a270.mp3", "Nam is in the school football team.": "audio/cau/1461f5ac62622ac5.mp3", "Our team won because of good teamwork.": "audio/cau/8c1642773db7fc33.mp3", "Nam is my teammate in the football club.": "audio/cau/8aad427069b03f2b.mp3", "Help your teammates during the game.": "audio/cau/aa515263fb79e5ef.mp3", "Teamwork is important in our project.": "audio/cau/2dab89eaeac4edea.mp3", "Each team needs good teamwork to win.": "audio/cau/e87a0a5f8aa964a4.mp3", "There are many technological changes today.": "audio/cau/33a74b88547cb63e.mp3", "Robots are a great technological invention.": "audio/cau/ee3060503424ac39.mp3", "Technology has changed our lives a lot.": "audio/cau/05507c037515517a.mp3", "He started a technology company and became successful.": "audio/cau/2afc10a553e39d7d.mp3", "My brother is a teen, so he wants his own room.": "audio/cau/c8eb1ac059c2bb4a.mp3", "A teenager is a teen between thirteen and nineteen.": "audio/cau/d1532a0567e7f8bc.mp3", "Teenage students often use social media.": "audio/cau/6439a5aadf508eec.mp3", "She has two teenage sons.": "audio/cau/1b22257023981880.mp3", "Most teenagers like music and games.": "audio/cau/a9bbd7adccb33a47.mp3", "As a teenager, he loved football.": "audio/cau/64a6cc4e62c5025e.mp3", "This camp is for teenagers aged 13 to 15.": "audio/cau/5cfe984ac3769531.mp3", "Many teenagers use phones, but adults use them too.": "audio/cau/21d9a5c45f2e6b47.mp3", "Many teens in the city feel stressed.": "audio/cau/369d9e6780081751.mp3", "Teens and teenagers mean the same thing.": "audio/cau/38da3d71f50d4767.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "I had breakfast, and then I went to school.": "audio/cau/e707895b95dcb0e6.mp3", "First, wash the rice. Next, cook it. Then, eat it.": "audio/cau/2bb6330c0be506ed.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "He is a creative thinker.": "audio/cau/f59f27869620f000.mp3", "Confucius was a great thinker.": "audio/cau/e0d23762cc277705.mp3", "That's a good thought!": "audio/cau/4c84ec15bb96b916.mp3", "I thought the test was easy.": "audio/cau/164ed73b13b1af06.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "Tick the correct answers.": "audio/cau/03211fde6b6a3087.mp3", "Put a tick next to the things you did.": "audio/cau/579b575a47a252d1.mp3", "I bought a train ticket to Hue.": "audio/cau/1debeb8b5ea23da5.mp3", "You need a ticket to enter the museum.": "audio/cau/2dd7e631f582680c.mp3", "What is the best title for the text?": "audio/cau/ab4d19ae5334140f.mp3", "The title of the song is very short.": "audio/cau/d45d206bcd3678e3.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "We went to Hue by train.": "audio/cau/0131cf3fca359ac1.mp3", "The train leaves the station at six.": "audio/cau/f47b7035aa339397.mp3", "She is a trainee teacher.": "audio/cau/8381752caa89fc9e.mp3", "The trainees learn from the chef.": "audio/cau/c5fa19c4afef7ff5.mp3", "My trainer helps me get fit.": "audio/cau/1330fae4fd91e16d.mp3", "The dog trainer is very patient.": "audio/cau/afceb91aad4b32e6.mp3", "Mai takes a training course on time management at school.": "audio/cau/a7ab4a64de2ddf3c.mp3", "Nam has football training every Saturday.": "audio/cau/594873cbffeb57ec.mp3", "Is it true that Nam can sing well?": "audio/cau/b793f0302657ab80.mp3", "The story is true, not false.": "audio/cau/fd6a61c02d4b7fe6.mp3", "I'm truly sorry.": "audio/cau/e7ae5dcb584f8045.mp3", "It was a truly beautiful day.": "audio/cau/b7c3ef82c1d2475c.mp3", "Please tell me the truth.": "audio/cau/09d3635c1d77c2fb.mp3", "He always tells the truth.": "audio/cau/1b99124c4acee059.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "A flat is a type of house.": "audio/cau/b519e22f39271e2a.mp3", "What type of house do you like? I like this kind.": "audio/cau/256a68fa7015d647.mp3", "There are many types of houses in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e5ec6990a0243557.mp3", "A villa is one type of house; which type do you like?": "audio/cau/36ad9745be611d00.mp3", "Below are some of the typical things I did.": "audio/cau/66d53ae758a3f7b4.mp3", "Pho is a typical Vietnamese breakfast.": "audio/cau/fbe03a0e67ca0879.mp3", "I was unable to come to the party.": "audio/cau/9a33ddb403bf9924.mp3", "She is unable to swim.": "audio/cau/c9dd522be7beb748.mp3", "Don't worry about unimportant things.": "audio/cau/f07810c695be3310.mp3", "This detail is unimportant.": "audio/cau/532d9addcc7fece9.mp3", "The film was long and uninteresting.": "audio/cau/fe255bc43d0bc7d1.mp3", "Nothing is uninteresting if you look closely.": "audio/cau/fbd9a81d434e40b7.mp3", "Today we are reviewing Unit 2.": "audio/cau/4cbb6e6ec2608275.mp3", "This unit is about houses, and the next unit is about friends.": "audio/cau/654b123e0b65a71f.mp3", "My brother studies at a university in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/d31bb0ff48e0784e.mp3", "I want to go to university in the future.": "audio/cau/e1a5eee05092757d.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "Turn off unnecessary lights.": "audio/cau/5283f14f10a6242d.mp3", "Don't buy unnecessary things.": "audio/cau/3c196996ebaf5b8d.mp3", "Give your unneeded clothes to charity.": "audio/cau/51be808aa1e5c17d.mp3", "We threw away the unneeded boxes.": "audio/cau/64c9c2b8514c0fc4.mp3", "The new rule is unpopular with students.": "audio/cau/0273c12663516408.mp3", "This game is unpopular now.": "audio/cau/6dc0deb47558dd88.mp3", "Some streets are unsafe at night.": "audio/cau/9e2a76800e149b06.mp3", "Swimming here is unsafe, so please swim in a safe place.": "audio/cau/550ede97cb8b4835.mp3", "That story is untrue.": "audio/cau/93e4988bfe2eafab.mp3", "Some news on the Internet is untrue.": "audio/cau/43deb053ae5f269d.mp3", "He was unwilling to help.": "audio/cau/4a68429060cc8922.mp3", "Some students are unwilling to speak English.": "audio/cau/22c29317046d7c03.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "My cousin goes to a vocational school.": "audio/cau/50ca5a6882ddb9d6.mp3", "Vocational training helps young people find jobs.": "audio/cau/75b1e5786be3eb6f.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "Why do you like this book?": "audio/cau/f853b0b3138e4625.mp3", "'Why are you late?' 'Because I missed the bus.'": "audio/cau/c4cf7bd9b30f00fd.mp3", "I will help you with your homework.": "audio/cau/09b1efdcdb577f02.mp3", "Lan will visit us tomorrow, but Nam won't come.": "audio/cau/b87ff8c1b6e3e1d4.mp3", "Mi is always willing to help her friends.": "audio/cau/39846a7a6b84f531.mp3", "Phong is willing to work, and he works willingly.": "audio/cau/932502c11dbc54c6.mp3", "She willingly helped her classmates.": "audio/cau/58cf7b2f942ad068.mp3", "He willingly shared his food.": "audio/cau/769030a9956a1176.mp3", "Thank you for your willingness to help.": "audio/cau/85b0dea75df09eb1.mp3", "Willingness to learn is important.": "audio/cau/fc255a0337734725.mp3", "I wish I could fly.": "audio/cau/1f4f98c1346e3311.mp3", "We wish you a happy new year.": "audio/cau/f468722ef2819696.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "The traffic is getting worse.": "audio/cau/b087dabc2647a0af.mp3", "My cold was bad yesterday, but today it is worse.": "audio/cau/17b44374c06cdd9f.mp3", "This is the worst film I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/2b6b7e86b637f5bc.mp3", "Monday is the worst day of the week for me.": "audio/cau/40b0df75c1307d68.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3"};
